# What is and is not a source, for everything under docs/.
#
# One file rather than one per document folder: a second document would other-
# wise need its own copy, and copies drift. Patterns here are matched against
# every path below docs/, so a new folder inherits these rules without anyone
# remembering to set it up.

# ---- build artefacts -------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by `tectonic main.tex` or latexmk. The .tex files and images/ are
# the sources; a committed PDF shows up as a changed binary on every rebuild and
# tells a reviewer nothing.
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.xdv
*.synctex.gz
*.pdf

# ---- not sources -----------------------------------------------------------
# A landing zone for generated files delivered from a chat session. Nothing in
# here should ever be the only copy of anything: if a file matters, move it into
# the document folder it belongs to.
claude-outputs/

# Superseded originals, kept on disk for reference. Deliberately NOT in git --
# they are binaries that cannot be diffed or reviewed, they will never be edited
# again, and adding them would put them in the repo's history permanently.
Old/

# macOS
.DS_Store
